    "# Indonesia Floods: Flood Proxy Maps, May 2022 The **Earth Observatory of Singapore – Remote Sensing Lab (EOS-RS)** produced these flood proxy maps for Indonesia Floods (May 2022) from synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite images. Each map is a separate ZIP below with its GeoTIFF, a KMZ for Google Earth, the PNG figures and a text file describing how it was made and how to read it. ## Maps in this dataset - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Indonesia, Floods, May 2022, v0.4** - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Indonesia, Floods, May 2022, v0.3** **More map details and files:** **More map details and files:**"
